(4798816, 694438, 93804, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors!  I like how the piece is layed out too, with the horse being off center, it adds interest.</td>', 'Very nice colors!  I like how the piece is layed out too, with the horse being off center, it adds interest.', '2008-07-02 15:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
