(4798840, 694434, 93804, '<td valign="top">Ooh!  What a neat effect!  The contrast makes this a powerful picture!</td>', 'Ooh!  What a neat effect!  The contrast makes this a powerful picture!', '2008-07-02 15:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
