(4798842, 693929, 93804, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!  Everything is so vivid!  I especially like the reflections in the water.</td>', 'Gorgeous!  Everything is so vivid!  I especially like the reflections in the water.', '2008-07-02 15:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
