(4798881, 693775, 93804, '<td valign="top">What interesting cows!  They really stand out and give some great contrast to the rest of your picture!</td>', 'What interesting cows!  They really stand out and give some great contrast to the rest of your picture!', '2008-07-02 15:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
