(4802497, 693918, 93565, '<td valign="top">The vignette from the lens detracts a bit, but I still like the reflection and the angle of the waterway.</td>', 'The vignette from the lens detracts a bit, but I still like the reflection and the angle of the waterway.', '2008-07-04 09:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802503, 693957, 93565, '<td valign="top">Black and white compliments the dilapidation perfectly. Nice composition.</td>', 'Black and white compliments the dilapidation perfectly. Nice composition.', '2008-07-04 09:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802504, 692284, 93756, '<td valign="top">Cool effect. I like it.</td>', 'Cool effect. I like it.', '2008-07-04 09:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802505, 694250, 93756, '<td valign="top">Fantastic field of wheat and nice hint of the farm buildings beyond. I think you could have done more justice to the cute child. The light or editing doesn''t flatter him somehow. I do like his placement in the frame.</td>', 'Fantastic field of wheat and nice hint of the farm buildings beyond. I think you could have done more justice to the cute child. The light or editing doesn''t flatter him somehow. I do like his placement in the frame.', '2008-07-04 09:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802506, 692179, 93756, '<td valign="top">Wow! Sure beats corn fields!</td>', 'Wow! Sure beats corn fields!', '2008-07-04 09:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802507, 694406, 93756, '<td valign="top">Looks like a contender for the Point of Color challenge too!</td>', 'Looks like a contender for the Point of Color challenge too!', '2008-07-04 09:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802510, 694339, 93756, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Maybe a little too sharpened? Maybe you could have cropped a little more to bring the house/trees bigger?</td>', 'Very nice. Maybe a little too sharpened? Maybe you could have cropped a little more to bring the house/trees bigger?', '2008-07-04 09:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802514, 693677, 93756, '<td valign="top">I think you could have found a prettier foreground. Mountain and sky are beautiful.</td>', 'I think you could have found a prettier foreground. Mountain and sky are beautiful.', '2008-07-04 09:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802515, 693960, 93756, '<td valign="top">I am really intrigued by the photo but it''s too dark to make out your subject. I wish you''d caught the light a little sooner before dusk settled in.</td>', 'I am really intrigued by the photo but it''s too dark to make out your subject. I wish you''d caught the light a little sooner before dusk settled in.', '2008-07-04 09:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802516, 693712, 93756, '<td valign="top">Pretty light but too much dark grass in the front. You could have cropped some of it out to move the eye even more towards the barn.</td>', 'Pretty light but too much dark grass in the front. You could have cropped some of it out to move the eye even more towards the barn.', '2008-07-04 09:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802517, 694248, 93756, '<td valign="top">I want to see more of the lavender! I wish you''d been a little closer and made the purple the 2/3 and the sky only the top 1/3. I see sky all the time but am not fortunate enough to see a field like this very often. Gorgeous colors!</td>', 'I want to see more of the lavender! I wish you''d been a little closer and made the purple the 2/3 and the sky only the top 1/3. I see sky all the time but am not fortunate enough to see a field like this very often. Gorgeous colors!', '2008-07-04 09:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802518, 693942, 93756, '<td valign="top">Looks like a postcard - pretty.</td>', 'Looks like a postcard - pretty.', '2008-07-04 09:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802519, 694253, 93756, '<td valign="top">Kind of tough to take a bad picture there, isn''t it? Lucky you! Gorgeous photo.</td>', 'Kind of tough to take a bad picture there, isn''t it? Lucky you! Gorgeous photo.', '2008-07-04 09:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802521, 693573, 93756, '<td valign="top">Close, but doesn''t quite work compositionally. Great texture and color contrast between the grass and grain. The tree should have been either more in focus or left out. Also, the dividing line should be either dead center or at the 1/3 point horizontally.</td>', 'Close, but doesn''t quite work compositionally. Great texture and color contrast between the grass and grain. The tree should have been either more in focus or left out. Also, the dividing line should be either dead center or at the 1/3 point horizontally.', '2008-07-04 09:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802522, 692743, 93756, '<td valign="top">You need some clouds - sky is kind of grey and boring. Cart and green/flowers are much more interesting. Crop!</td>', 'You need some clouds - sky is kind of grey and boring. Cart and green/flowers are much more interesting. Crop!', '2008-07-04 09:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802588, 694245, 81530, '<td valign="top">Love the light and the details in this photograph</td>', 'Love the light and the details in this photograph', '2008-07-04 10:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802954, 692112, 42254, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition &amp; location.  Perhaps a bit more contrast would really make it come alive.</td>', 'Lovely composition & location.  Perhaps a bit more contrast would really make it come alive.', '2008-07-04 15:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802956, 694349, 42254, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition &amp; scene with a pastoral softness to it.</td>', 'Beautiful composition & scene with a pastoral softness to it.', '2008-07-04 15:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802961, 693139, 42254, '<td valign="top">Striking sky over interesting structure &amp; rural expanse.</td>', 'Striking sky over interesting structure & rural expanse.', '2008-07-04 15:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802965, 694236, 42254, '<td valign="top">What is she thinking? The rural lass takes this shot out of the ordinary landscape.  Great composition and exposure.  A bluer sky would be nice but not sure you could do it with basic editing.</td>', 'What is she thinking? The rural lass takes this shot out of the ordinary landscape.  Great composition and exposure.  A bluer sky would be nice but not sure you could do it with basic editing.', '2008-07-04 15:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802967, 694324, 42254, '<td valign="top">Would look great on the LR wall!</td>', 'Would look great on the LR wall!', '2008-07-04 15:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802972, 693180, 42254, '<td valign="top">The irrigation ditch really leads the viewer''s eye, but not to the other center of interest--the herder and his livestock. So my eyes go back &amp; forth. Still it is a very interesting shot with good color contrasts.</td>', 'The irrigation ditch really leads the viewer''s eye, but not to the other center of interest--the herder and his livestock. So my eyes go back & forth. Still it is a very interesting shot with good color contrasts.', '2008-07-04 15:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802973, 692796, 42254, '<td valign="top">Lovely pastoral scene--at least until that storm arrives!  Excellent angle.</td>', 'Lovely pastoral scene--at least until that storm arrives!  Excellent angle.', '2008-07-04 15:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802979, 693666, 42254, '<td valign="top">Very colorful and rural, but very ordinary as well. Perhaps if you and shot it at knee level, you might have had a dramatic shot.</td>', 'Very colorful and rural, but very ordinary as well. Perhaps if you and shot it at knee level, you might have had a dramatic shot.', '2008-07-04 15:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802984, 692974, 42254, '<td valign="top">Beautiful contrasts due to your excellent composition &amp; angle.</td>', 'Beautiful contrasts due to your excellent composition & angle.', '2008-07-04 16:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803017, 691723, 42254, '<td valign="top">Beautiful contrast of barns with sky; needs something of interest in foreground or to get closer to the wagon.</td>', 'Beautiful contrast of barns with sky; needs something of interest in foreground or to get closer to the wagon.', '2008-07-04 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803018, 692604, 42254, '<td valign="top">Evening pastoral!  Beautiful Shot!</td>', 'Evening pastoral!  Beautiful Shot!', '2008-07-04 16:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803021, 692997, 42254, '<td valign="top">Great color, sharpness &amp; use of thirds.</td>', 'Great color, sharpness & use of thirds.', '2008-07-04 16:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803024, 694185, 42254, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flowers-sky.  I like the way the flowers lead the eye to the expansive sky. Unfortunately, the road distracts from that leading the eye to a tree. Perhaps crop most or the road and sacrifice some of the sky expanse.</td>', 'Beautiful flowers-sky.  I like the way the flowers lead the eye to the expansive sky. Unfortunately, the road distracts from that leading the eye to a tree. Perhaps crop most or the road and sacrifice some of the sky expanse.', '2008-07-04 16:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803025, 693581, 42254, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene, costrasts, &amp; viewing angle.</td>', 'Lovely scene, costrasts, & viewing angle.', '2008-07-04 16:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803036, 694110, 42254, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene. Perhaps cropping out the bottom 1/5th or 1/6th would help by bringing the steer into the close foreground.  Then the eye would move up to the trees and great mountain range.</td>', 'Beautiful scene. Perhaps cropping out the bottom 1/5th or 1/6th would help by bringing the steer into the close foreground.  Then the eye would move up to the trees and great mountain range.', '2008-07-04 16:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803038, 694161, 42254, '<td valign="top">Yes! Minimal and very pastoral.</td>', 'Yes! Minimal and very pastoral.', '2008-07-04 16:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803039, 692963, 42254, '<td valign="top">Nice composition &amp; contrasts.</td>', 'Nice composition & contrasts.', '2008-07-04 16:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803040, 692808, 42254, '<td valign="top">Striking color.</td>', 'Striking color.', '2008-07-04 16:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803042, 693466, 42254, '<td valign="top">Beautiful night shot!</td>', 'Beautiful night shot!', '2008-07-04 16:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803043, 694128, 42254, '<td valign="top">Peaceful--the ducks make the shot. Good composition.</td>', 'Peaceful--the ducks make the shot. Good composition.', '2008-07-04 16:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803046, 692473, 42254, '<td valign="top">Nice!  Fence/wall angles, color contrasts, mist, and light are striking.</td>', 'Nice!  Fence/wall angles, color contrasts, mist, and light are striking.', '2008-07-04 16:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803047, 692951, 42254, '<td valign="top">Cropping out most of the sky would transform this shot into a panorama giving a very different feeling.</td>', 'Cropping out most of the sky would transform this shot into a panorama giving a very different feeling.', '2008-07-04 16:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803049, 694352, 42254, '<td valign="top">Wow! what sky &amp; reflections with great yellow contrast in foreground.</td>', 'Wow! what sky & reflections with great yellow contrast in foreground.', '2008-07-04 17:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803050, 694248, 42254, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, but cropping sky just above white cloud will enhance the expanse of lavender effect. Too much sky distracts from the great foreground.</td>', 'Beautiful, but cropping sky just above white cloud will enhance the expanse of lavender effect. Too much sky distracts from the great foreground.', '2008-07-04 17:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803052, 693000, 42254, '<td valign="top">Lovely softness.</td>', 'Lovely softness.', '2008-07-04 17:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803113, 694351, 63750, '<td valign="top">This is a nice scene. Something about the PP doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'This is a nice scene. Something about the PP doesn''t work for me.', '2008-07-04 18:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803115, 694203, 63750, '<td valign="top">Tough call on this. If you crop the bottom, you may lose the perspective of the house, but the angled foreground is distracting. Perhaps straighten to the foreground line then crop up to the edge of the house from the bottom?</td>', 'Tough call on this. If you crop the bottom, you may lose the perspective of the house, but the angled foreground is distracting. Perhaps straighten to the foreground line then crop up to the edge of the house from the bottom?', '2008-07-04 18:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803116, 692473, 63750, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! The lighting is superb and the fence is a great strong diagonal element.  Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful! The lighting is superb and the fence is a great strong diagonal element.  Well done.', '2008-07-04 18:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803117, 694356, 63750, '<td valign="top">Not sure the sepia works here.</td>', 'Not sure the sepia works here.', '2008-07-04 18:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803118, 694245, 63750, '<td valign="top">Good desat. Very well done.</td>', 'Good desat. Very well done.', '2008-07-04 18:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803120, 693918, 63750, '<td valign="top">Nice! You handled the lighting challenge of this scene very well.</td>', 'Nice! You handled the lighting challenge of this scene very well.', '2008-07-04 18:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803122, 693000, 63750, '<td valign="top">Nice. I think a little more DOF might have worked a bit better. Love the treatment of the haze.</td>', 'Nice. I think a little more DOF might have worked a bit better. Love the treatment of the haze.', '2008-07-04 18:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803131, 694379, 63750, '<td valign="top">The treatment here is very good. I think the cool colors work. The rippled area provide a little more visual interest than if it were all flat. Well done.</td>', 'The treatment here is very good. I think the cool colors work. The rippled area provide a little more visual interest than if it were all flat. Well done.', '2008-07-04 18:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803136, 693888, 63750, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.</td>', 'Very nicely done.', '2008-07-04 18:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803149, 693613, 42254, '<td valign="top">Dramatic - Great effect from fisheye &amp; the sky.</td>', 'Dramatic - Great effect from fisheye & the sky.', '2008-07-04 19:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803161, 694378, 42254, '<td valign="top">Beautiful contrasts &amp; nice balance.</td>', 'Beautiful contrasts & nice balance.', '2008-07-04 19:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803165, 694219, 42254, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot with sharp, lighted foreground and soft background.</td>', 'Lovely shot with sharp, lighted foreground and soft background.', '2008-07-04 19:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803169, 693853, 42254, '<td valign="top">Beautiful effects &amp; handling of sun - striking minimalizm.</td>', 'Beautiful effects & handling of sun - striking minimalizm.', '2008-07-04 19:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803322, 694379, 83686, '<td valign="top">Is this Enzo with the blue again???</td>', 'Is this Enzo with the blue again???', '2008-07-04 20:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803328, 692082, 66515, '<td valign="top">A little small. By about half actually (you can go up to 640 px). The bigger the image the easier it is for the viewer to see (and therefore appreciate) the details in your shot.</td>', 'A little small. By about half actually (you can go up to 640 px). The bigger the image the easier it is for the viewer to see (and therefore appreciate) the details in your shot.', '2008-07-04 20:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803422, 693614, 15291, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image, The compostion is nicely done. I really like the placement of the elements &amp; it''s framing. The tonality is very nice &amp; the reflections are great.</td>', 'Wonderful image, The compostion is nicely done. I really like the placement of the elements & it''s framing. The tonality is very nice & the reflections are great.', '2008-07-04 22:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803425, 694352, 15291, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image, the colors are vivid. The image is clean &amp; sharp.</td>', 'Wonderful image, the colors are vivid. The image is clean & sharp.', '2008-07-04 22:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803437, 693682, 15291, '<td valign="top">Love the overall image, for me it has lots of interest. I like your composition and it''s framing. Great job keeping the texture in the entire image &amp; the tonality looks natural. Looks like front page at the very least. Imho I think this should ribbion.</td>', 'Love the overall image, for me it has lots of interest. I like your composition and it''s framing. Great job keeping the texture in the entire image & the tonality looks natural. Looks like front page at the very least. Imho I think this should ribbion.', '2008-07-04 22:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803440, 693398, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nice image, I think you intended this to be in the light buld challenge &amp; hit the wrong button.</td>', 'Nice image, I think you intended this to be in the light buld challenge & hit the wrong button.', '2008-07-04 22:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803442, 692599, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nice image but the focus seems a bit soft &amp; the dodge &amp; burn seem un-natural.</td>', 'Nice image but the focus seems a bit soft & the dodge & burn seem un-natural.', '2008-07-04 22:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803447, 694351, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nice image, I like the compostion and the tonality of the image. The piece of equipment seems to be a bit out of scale in relation to the fence. With that being said I have know idea how big that thing is I am just pointing out the relationship between the two.</td>', 'Nice image, I like the compostion and the tonality of the image. The piece of equipment seems to be a bit out of scale in relation to the fence. With that being said I have know idea how big that thing is I am just pointing out the relationship between the two.', '2008-07-04 22:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803449, 693701, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, Love the compostion &amp; framing here. The colors are nice &amp; natural looking.</td>', 'Nicely done, Love the compostion & framing here. The colors are nice & natural looking.', '2008-07-04 22:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803458, 691943, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nice image, the composition &amp; framing are well done. Like the rustic look of the image. Seems like the one section of sky you captured is slightly blown out.</td>', 'Nice image, the composition & framing are well done. Like the rustic look of the image. Seems like the one section of sky you captured is slightly blown out.', '2008-07-04 22:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803462, 693001, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, composition is nice but the sky is a bit over exposed.</td>', 'Nice capture, composition is nice but the sky is a bit over exposed.', '2008-07-04 22:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803467, 692265, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, the composition &amp; framing is well done. Nice job on the reflection. The colors are nice and natural.</td>', 'Nice capture, the composition & framing is well done. Nice job on the reflection. The colors are nice and natural.', '2008-07-04 22:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803483, 693712, 15291, '<td valign="top">I have to say i don''t know weather it is the title, the image or both. But very few images I have seen over the years here have moved me, or brought out raw emotion as this. I was instantly taken back in time to that tragic events at the Amish school &amp; after all is''nt that what photography is all about.</td>', 'I have to say i don''t know weather it is the title, the image or both. But very few images I have seen over the years here have moved me, or brought out raw emotion as this. I was instantly taken back in time to that tragic events at the Amish school & after all is''nt that what photography is all about.', '2008-07-04 23:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803486, 693581, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, I like your composition &amp; framing here. I really like the texture you were able to uptane tho-out the image.</td>', 'Nicely done, I like your composition & framing here. I really like the texture you were able to uptane tho-out the image.', '2008-07-04 23:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803489, 694434, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, The composition is well done.</td>', 'Nice capture, The composition is well done.', '2008-07-04 23:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803615, 694410, 27421, '<td valign="top">Great exposure or PP, whichever....7</td>', 'Great exposure or PP, whichever....7', '2008-07-05 00:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803619, 692642, 27421, '<td valign="top">Only people are wicked...:)</td>', 'Only people are wicked...:)', '2008-07-05 01:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803622, 694245, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  I love it because it has interesting light and the interest of the mist in the background.</td>', 'Very pretty.  I love it because it has interesting light and the interest of the mist in the background.', '2008-07-05 01:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803624, 693247, 24454, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2008-07-05 01:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803625, 694107, 27421, '<td valign="top">??White balance?? Not sure....4</td>', '??White balance?? Not sure....4', '2008-07-05 01:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803626, 694356, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is really beuautiful.</td>', 'This is really beuautiful.', '2008-07-05 01:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803629, 693581, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is pretty much the scene that first pops into my mind when I think of rural landscape.   Nicely done!!!</td>', 'This is pretty much the scene that first pops into my mind when I think of rural landscape.   Nicely done!!!', '2008-07-05 01:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803632, 692662, 27421, '<td valign="top">Never been...looks nice...6</td>', 'Never been...looks nice...6', '2008-07-05 01:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803633, 692796, 24454, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.  At seems very artful and interestingly composed.  And I like the title alot too :)</td>', 'I really like this one.  At seems very artful and interestingly composed.  And I like the title alot too :)', '2008-07-05 01:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803636, 694423, 24454, '<td valign="top">Auuuuuughhhh. . . .I''m way too jealous to be fair :)  Juuuuust kidding!  This is so beautiful it makes my heart ache to go there!  I went there alot when my grandma lived in Tennessee.  Very VERY nicely done!</td>', 'Auuuuuughhhh. . . .I''m way too jealous to be fair :)  Juuuuust kidding!  This is so beautiful it makes my heart ache to go there!  I went there alot when my grandma lived in Tennessee.  Very VERY nicely done!', '2008-07-05 01:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803638, 692662, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh how quaint and beautiful.  I''ve always wanted to go to Vermont.  Now even more so!  Nicely done!</td>', 'Ohhhh how quaint and beautiful.  I''ve always wanted to go to Vermont.  Now even more so!  Nicely done!', '2008-07-05 01:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
