(4805206, 694248, 79090, '<td valign="top">the crop is odd...the bottom portion needs a tad more depth for balance, otherwise the colors are nice in bands...</td>', 'the crop is odd...the bottom portion needs a tad more depth for balance, otherwise the colors are nice in bands...', '2008-07-05 17:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4805213, 694398, 79090, '<td valign="top">the clouds look odd, too photoshopped...i think the highlights were taken out too much...with having the clouds as powerful as the silouette, the photo i think has no focus...the ridge line is nice as it is...a simpler sky would be more advantageous potentially. 5</td>', 'the clouds look odd, too photoshopped...i think the highlights were taken out too much...with having the clouds as powerful as the silouette, the photo i think has no focus...the ridge line is nice as it is...a simpler sky would be more advantageous potentially. 5', '2008-07-05 17:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4805222, 693573, 79090, '<td valign="top">this is so nice, the composition is very thoughtful. i would even suggest taking the photo a touch lower, so the horizon is slightly lower, to suggest the aim is almost within the line...then would lead you to the tree instead of the tree first. 7</td>', 'this is so nice, the composition is very thoughtful. i would even suggest taking the photo a touch lower, so the horizon is slightly lower, to suggest the aim is almost within the line...then would lead you to the tree instead of the tree first. 7', '2008-07-05 17:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
