(4805929, 692951, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like the choice to provide of the big sky in this shot - it grounds the image and provides a bit of metaphor for the church.  i think the light is a bit too harsh on the front of the chuch</td>', 'i like the choice to provide of the big sky in this shot - it grounds the image and provides a bit of metaphor for the church.  i think the light is a bit too harsh on the front of the chuch', '2008-07-05 23:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
