(4806030, 694431, 82985, '<td valign="top">very nice indeed.</td>', 'very nice indeed.', '2008-07-06 00:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4806034, 694419, 82985, '<td valign="top">This area looks familiar to me.  Will be interesting to see if it is where I think it is.  Garbled words aside, this is wonderful and luminous.</td>', 'This area looks familiar to me.  Will be interesting to see if it is where I think it is.  Garbled words aside, this is wonderful and luminous.', '2008-07-06 00:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4806037, 694434, 82985, '<td valign="top">DPC GTG in your backyard?  Say where, say when.   Seriously, though, beautiful image, nicely composed and exposed, beautiful layers... 8</td>', 'DPC GTG in your backyard?  Say where, say when.   Seriously, though, beautiful image, nicely composed and exposed, beautiful layers... 8', '2008-07-06 00:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4806048, 694161, 82985, '<td valign="top">great image!  you may want to consider a bit of cropping to enhance the loneliness of the tree:  a crop up from the bottom to just under the dark horizontal streaks in the foreground, a crop from the left to remove the shadow creeping in at the side, and a tiny crop from the right to remove the element on the horizon.  After those, some cropping from the top might be warranted to restore the balance and structure of the composition.  Or, you may want to consider disregarding this suggestion completely! :-) 8</td>', 'great image!  you may want to consider a bit of cropping to enhance the loneliness of the tree:  a crop up from the bottom to just under the dark horizontal streaks in the foreground, a crop from the left to remove the shadow creeping in at the side, and a tiny crop from the right to remove the element on the horizon.  After those, some cropping from the top might be warranted to restore the balance and structure of the composition.  Or, you may want to consider disregarding this suggestion completely! :-) 8', '2008-07-06 00:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4806057, 693689, 82985, '<td valign="top">This is very well shot and seen.  I always struggle, in images like this, with where to crop in the sky to eliminate distracting elements.  You might be able to crop just below the main dark cloud in the sky, creating a bit of asymmetry, and have the image still work well (the reflections in the water, to me, are the primary features of the composition).  But don''t listen to me--it is your image :-)  8</td>', 'This is very well shot and seen.  I always struggle, in images like this, with where to crop in the sky to eliminate distracting elements.  You might be able to crop just below the main dark cloud in the sky, creating a bit of asymmetry, and have the image still work well (the reflections in the water, to me, are the primary features of the composition).  But don''t listen to me--it is your image :-)  8', '2008-07-06 00:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4806059, 693631, 82985, '<td valign="top">beautiful landscape, wind on the water, and backlit rain in the distance.  well done.  8</td>', 'beautiful landscape, wind on the water, and backlit rain in the distance.  well done.  8', '2008-07-06 00:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4806062, 693000, 82985, '<td valign="top">peaceful pastoral landscape.  it might be worth a look to see if cropping down about 10% vertically from the top helps or hinders, but it still gets an 8 from me either way</td>', 'peaceful pastoral landscape.  it might be worth a look to see if cropping down about 10% vertically from the top helps or hinders, but it still gets an 8 from me either way', '2008-07-06 00:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4806134, 692016, 77196, '<td valign="top">Rural? Nice photo - yellow provides a splash of color - sky is very nice blue.</td>', 'Rural? Nice photo - yellow provides a splash of color - sky is very nice blue.', '2008-07-06 01:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4806477, 691976, 37252, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective, but find the washed out colors and blown highlights really hurt this image. Focus seems soft too.</td>', 'I like the perspective, but find the washed out colors and blown highlights really hurt this image. Focus seems soft too.', '2008-07-06 04:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4806480, 694161, 37252, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and minimalism. I like the tiny little house on the far right. This brought me to the thought of how this may have been improved by shooting a different angle....placing the tree in the lower left third, and the house along the right as it is here.</td>', 'Very nice colors and minimalism. I like the tiny little house on the far right. This brought me to the thought of how this may have been improved by shooting a different angle....placing the tree in the lower left third, and the house along the right as it is here.', '2008-07-06 04:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4806483, 693738, 37252, '<td valign="top">ouch - looks like the pp got out of hand here. The colors seem way over saturated, to the point of blowing out any details on the tepee.</td>', 'ouch - looks like the pp got out of hand here. The colors seem way over saturated, to the point of blowing out any details on the tepee.', '2008-07-06 04:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4806487, 692249, 37252, '<td valign="top">Nice image. The shadows seem a bit too dark, but the colors look nice and natural. Not at all over saturated as several other images in this challenge are. I like that you didn''t try to over do it in your pp. I''d get rid of the frame though as it doesn''t compliment the scenerey at all.</td>', 'Nice image. The shadows seem a bit too dark, but the colors look nice and natural. Not at all over saturated as several other images in this challenge are. I like that you didn''t try to over do it in your pp. I''d get rid of the frame though as it doesn''t compliment the scenerey at all.', '2008-07-06 05:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4806489, 694026, 37252, '<td valign="top">Nice scenery but looks a bit over sharpened leaving the distracting halo effect between ground and sky.</td>', 'Nice scenery but looks a bit over sharpened leaving the distracting halo effect between ground and sky.', '2008-07-06 05:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4806492, 694352, 37252, '<td valign="top">stunning view!</td>', 'stunning view!', '2008-07-06 05:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
