(4806496, 693001, 37252, '<td valign="top">Aside from the blown sky and slight over saturation of colors, this is a nice shot. Your composition and perspective are well executed.</td>', 'Aside from the blown sky and slight over saturation of colors, this is a nice shot. Your composition and perspective are well executed.', '2008-07-06 05:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
