(4810205, 694352, 86447, '<td valign="top">Wow.  One of my top three.   Beautiful colors and reflection.   The PP is perfect.</td>', 'Wow.  One of my top three.   Beautiful colors and reflection.   The PP is perfect.', '2008-07-07 21:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4810207, 693000, 86447, '<td valign="top">One of my top three.   I really like the tractor out of focus a tad bit.  At first, I wanted it in focus... but the more I view this, the more I like it. I''m sure you knew it right off!</td>', 'One of my top three.   I really like the tractor out of focus a tad bit.  At first, I wanted it in focus... but the more I view this, the more I like it. I''m sure you knew it right off!', '2008-07-07 21:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
