(4810210, 694339, 86447, '<td valign="top">I really like the whole triangle thing you have going on here with the reflection and the ''real''.<br/> <br/>This is lovely.</td>', 'I really like the whole triangle thing you have going on here with the reflection and the ''real''. This is lovely.', '2008-07-07 21:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4810213, 693689, 86447, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a sunset!   Well captured.   The colors and sharpness are well done.</td>', 'Wow, what a sunset!   Well captured.   The colors and sharpness are well done.', '2008-07-07 21:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4810216, 693918, 86447, '<td valign="top">The cloud/sky reflection in the water just makes this stunning.  Well done!<br/> <br/>If it weren''t for that smidgeon of sun flare on the left bank, this would be darn near perfect.</td>', 'The cloud/sky reflection in the water just makes this stunning.  Well done! If it weren''t for that smidgeon of sun flare on the left bank, this would be darn near perfect.', '2008-07-07 21:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
