(4810224, 692874, 86447, '<td valign="top">I like the mystery of the buildings here.  So many folks would have walked a few steps forward to tell us what the buildings are, instead of letting us imagine it ourselves.   More fun this way.  *grin*<br/> <br/>Perfectly composed, IMHO.</td>', 'I like the mystery of the buildings here.  So many folks would have walked a few steps forward to tell us what the buildings are, instead of letting us imagine it ourselves.   More fun this way.  *grin* Perfectly composed, IMHO.', '2008-07-07 21:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
