(4813653, 692281, 79141, '<td valign="top">Vtruan<br/>i titled this because being in Australia where we have probably the most abundant sunshine and still have a heavy need for mining fossil fuels rather than look into more enviro friendly means of energy<br/>to see how badly this area has been mined is what made me title the image such.<br/>thanks for your comment<br/> <br/>echoman<br/>i was tossing up between this and the color version i did submit the color first maybe i should have gone with the original<br/>thanks for the comment<br/> <br/>SaraR<br/>i have to agree as i stated earlier it really is such a waste seeing this area<br/>thanks for the comment<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-07-09 01:59:30.</i></td>', 'Vtruani titled this because being in Australia where we have probably the most abundant sunshine and still have a heavy need for mining fossil fuels rather than look into more enviro friendly means of energyto see how badly this area has been mined is what made me title the image such.thanks for your comment echomani was tossing up between this and the color version i did submit the color first maybe i should have gone with the originalthanks for the comment SaraRi have to agree as i stated earlier it really is such a waste seeing this areathanks for the comment', '2008-07-09 02:57:50.000000', '2008-07-09 02:59:30.000000', 0),
