(4813926, 694236, 89341, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=697252" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697252.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697252.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697252.gif"/></a> from me in <a href="//dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=797556" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Posthumous Ribbons</a> <br/> <br/>Having Hannah in the shot really gives a great perspective, the patterns of the corn(?) are very good with the added bonus of the barns in the background</td>', ' from me in Posthumous Ribbons  Having Hannah in the shot really gives a great perspective, the patterns of the corn(?) are very good with the added bonus of the barns in the background', '2008-07-09 07:22:11.000000', NULL, 0),
