(4813934, 694352, 7786, '<td valign="top">Congratulations with a well deserved blue ribbon and a brilliant image.</td>', 'Congratulations with a well deserved blue ribbon and a brilliant image.', '2008-07-09 07:28:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4813956, 692867, 67152, '<td valign="top">A cool title for a cool photo.  I haven''t seen crop dusters in a long time.  <br/> <br/>I think the shot has a lot of potential, but may have suffered from a couple of minor issues. <br/>1) the cropduster is pointed away as if it was captured in passing rather than on purpose - DPC voters love effort and over the top in your face shots <br/>2) the sky is a bit blotchy, likely due to the resizing artifacts <br/>3) I think the light on the crops is excellent but it seems that the darkness of the leaves on the trees swollowed up the light and gave the image a darker than intended feel</td>', 'A cool title for a cool photo.  I haven''t seen crop dusters in a long time.   I think the shot has a lot of potential, but may have suffered from a couple of minor issues. 1) the cropduster is pointed away as if it was captured in passing rather than on purpose - DPC voters love effort and over the top in your face shots 2) the sky is a bit blotchy, likely due to the resizing artifacts 3) I think the light on the crops is excellent but it seems that the darkness of the leaves on the trees swollowed up the light and gave the image a darker than intended feel', '2008-07-09 07:57:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4813958, 694185, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene and beautiful colors. It seems unnaturally bright, but that gives it a lot of ''wow'' and makes me linger in the scene, enjoying all the details. I love what the wide angle has done for the sky.</td>', 'Beautiful scene and beautiful colors. It seems unnaturally bright, but that gives it a lot of ''wow'' and makes me linger in the scene, enjoying all the details. I love what the wide angle has done for the sky.', '2008-07-09 08:01:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4813960, 692453, 67152, '<td valign="top">Steve - an artistic effort in the rural challenge.  I think the shot has a lot of potential, from the deep contrast between the black mailbox and the bright white letters, to the red flag up telling us there is some anticipation to the shot, to the flatness of the ground speaking rural farming. But I wonder about the choice of colors and hues in the sky - it seems very muted.  Also, I wonder if a wider shot with the mailbox a bit over to the left and smaller on screen would have provided more of a feel of open space.  In addition, by placing the box a bit to the left, you may have been able to cover the houses up on the left of the image and made this feel even more rural.<br/> <br/>Keep up the good work!</td>', 'Steve - an artistic effort in the rural challenge.  I think the shot has a lot of potential, from the deep contrast between the black mailbox and the bright white letters, to the red flag up telling us there is some anticipation to the shot, to the flatness of the ground speaking rural farming. But I wonder about the choice of colors and hues in the sky - it seems very muted.  Also, I wonder if a wider shot with the mailbox a bit over to the left and smaller on screen would have provided more of a feel of open space.  In addition, by placing the box a bit to the left, you may have been able to cover the houses up on the left of the image and made this feel even more rural. Keep up the good work!', '2008-07-09 08:01:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4813962, 694185, 67152, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful and colorful scene - almost a painting more than a photo</td>', 'What a beautiful and colorful scene - almost a painting more than a photo', '2008-07-09 08:03:09.000000', NULL, 0),
