(4814232, 692473, 66193, '<td valign="top">Peter, congrats again.  Two 7''s in a row (close enough)!  I think I will take you up on the offer of advice and help!  I drive by there at least 5 times a week, and I would never have stopped at that spot.  Very well seen, and an excellent photo.</td>', 'Peter, congrats again.  Two 7''s in a row (close enough)!  I think I will take you up on the offer of advice and help!  I drive by there at least 5 times a week, and I would never have stopped at that spot.  Very well seen, and an excellent photo.', '2008-07-09 09:50:13.000000', NULL, 0),
