(4814312, 694236, 51538, '<td valign="top">You get the viewer involved with this photo.  Not perfect composition, but lures the attention into the frame and the day...  interesting effect.  I can learn something from this.</td>', 'You get the viewer involved with this photo.  Not perfect composition, but lures the attention into the frame and the day...  interesting effect.  I can learn something from this.', '2008-07-09 10:09:54.000000', NULL, 0),
