(4816381, 693613, 68504, '<td valign="top">Perhaps it could be brighter, but taking the time to look, the texture and and scale and extent of the bales and stubble are quite impressive, and there is an amazing counterplay of lines in the cloudlit sky.  My sense of this is that it needs to be seen in much larger scale to get the full effect.</td>', 'Perhaps it could be brighter, but taking the time to look, the texture and and scale and extent of the bales and stubble are quite impressive, and there is an amazing counterplay of lines in the cloudlit sky.  My sense of this is that it needs to be seen in much larger scale to get the full effect.', '2008-07-10 01:12:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4816395, 694349, 68504, '<td valign="top">Amazing scenery, but the power is in the archetypal animal, so dark, so there, anchored by the red highlights that tie her/him to the reddish grasses. Looked for quite awhile.</td>', 'Amazing scenery, but the power is in the archetypal animal, so dark, so there, anchored by the red highlights that tie her/him to the reddish grasses. Looked for quite awhile.', '2008-07-10 01:23:13.000000', NULL, 0),
