(4816467, 694411, 68504, '<td valign="top">I like your outtakes too, over the top as they are colourwise. (A  very long time ago I took a very low tech bike camping trip through the tobacco country to Long Point, starting from Toronto, and it was one of the best "seeing" trips I ever made.  This brings it back).</td>', 'I like your outtakes too, over the top as they are colourwise. (A  very long time ago I took a very low tech bike camping trip through the tobacco country to Long Point, starting from Toronto, and it was one of the best "seeing" trips I ever made.  This brings it back).', '2008-07-10 01:53:29.000000', NULL, 0),
