(4830485, 694313, 45475, '<td valign="top">Holy moly, this is yours? I just about cried when I first saw it. I love this for being an honest representation of an awesome event. No fancy saturation or dodge and burn... just the weather as you saw it at that moment.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-07-17 17:27:45.</i></td>', 'Holy moly, this is yours? I just about cried when I first saw it. I love this for being an honest representation of an awesome event. No fancy saturation or dodge and burn... just the weather as you saw it at that moment.', '2008-07-17 04:50:40.000000', '2008-07-17 18:27:45.000000', 0),
