(4831212, 694325, 67697, '<td valign="top">That''s fun.  It''s almost like someone was playing a game with the bales.  I love the golden hue vs. turquoise hue contrast.</td>', 'That''s fun.  It''s almost like someone was playing a game with the bales.  I love the golden hue vs. turquoise hue contrast.', '2008-07-17 16:44:45.000000', NULL, 0),
