(5665154, 694112, 32767, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pineapple:</b></div><hr/><i> What is that black dot over the centre horizon.  An errant bird?  Bit annoying for me.  But obviously the only one who thought so. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It''s odd I''ve looked at this shot many times and never even noticed the bird/dot. It''s strange what annoys people and weirder that half the time it''s things I barely would notice, dare mention.</td>', 'Originally posted by pineapple: What is that black dot over the centre horizon.  An errant bird?  Bit annoying for me.  But obviously the only one who thought so.   It''s odd I''ve looked at this shot many times and never even noticed the bird/dot. It''s strange what annoys people and weirder that half the time it''s things I barely would notice, dare mention.', '2009-09-28 15:31:52.000000', NULL, 0),
